{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\"\n       version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <state id=\"idle\" event:schema='{\"type\": \"object\"}'>\n    <onentry>\n      <event:schema/>\n    </onentry>\n    <transition event=\"order\" target=\"done\" event:schma=\"true\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":3,"notes":0,"total":3,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":34,"byteOffset":204,"endColumn":53,"endLine":4,"startColumn":19,"startLine":4},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `event:schema`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":53,"endLine":4,"startColumn":20,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`event:schema` is not allowed on `<state>`\n\n**Note:** the `event` vocabulary describes event data only on `<transition>`, `<send>`, `<raise>`, or `<donedata>`: the `_event.data` a transition handles, the data a `<send>` or `<raise>` creates its event with, or the data of the `done.state.<id>` event of a `<donedata>`\n\n**Help:** move the attribute to `<transition>`, `<send>`, `<raise>`, or `<donedata>`, or remove it","text":"`event:schema` is not allowed on `<state>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":238,"start":205},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"EVENT001"},{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":20,"endLine":6,"startColumn":8,"startLine":6}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<event:schema>` is an element in the `event` namespace, which has none\n\n**Note:** `https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event` is an attribute vocabulary only: `event:schema` or `event:schemaexpr` on `<transition>`, `<send>`, `<raise>`, or `<donedata>` describes the event data the element handles or creates\n\n**Help:** remove the element, and describe the event data with an `event:schema` attribute on the element that handles or creates it","text":"`<event:schema>` is an element in the `event` namespace, which has none"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":273,"start":261},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"EVENT001"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":5,"byteOffset":341,"endColumn":56,"endLine":8,"startColumn":51,"startLine":8},"insertedContent":{"text":"schema"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use `schema`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event001-event-vocabulary-misplaced.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":63,"endLine":8,"startColumn":45,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`event:schma` is not an attribute of the `event` vocabulary\n\n**Note:** the `event` vocabulary has exactly two attributes: `event:schema` (a JSON Schema, inline or by reference) and `event:schemaexpr` (an expression whose value is the schema)\n\n**Help:** did you mean `schema`?","text":"`event:schma` is not an attribute of the `event` vocabulary"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":353,"start":335},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"EVENT001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event` is the host's attribute vocabulary for describing event data: `event:schema` and `event:schemaexpr` on `<transition>` (the `_event.data` it handles), `<send>` and `<raise>` (the data their event is created with), and `<donedata>` (the data of the `done.state.<id>` event). It has no elements, no other attributes, and means nothing on any other element. The W3C schema admits attributes in other namespaces laxly, so only this rule catches a misplaced or misspelled one"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move the attribute to the element whose event data it describes, correct its name, or remove it.\n\nRun `scx --explain EVENT001` for examples."},"id":"EVENT001","name":"EVENT001","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the `event` namespace is used outside the attributes of an element with event data"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}